{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17974","headline":"利劒 · 韩愈","name":"利劒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"利劒光耿耿，佩之使我无邪心。\n故人念我寡徒侣，持用赠我比知音。\n我心如冰劒如雪，不能刺谗夫。\n使我心腐劒锋折，决云中断开青天。\n噫，劒与我俱变化归黄泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}